# Everything is LF in the repository AND in the checkout. npm pack tarballs the
# WORKING TREE, so on a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true an unpinned repo
# publishes a CRLF shebang and `npx realized-apy` dies on Linux and macOS with
# `/usr/bin/env: 'node': No such file or directory`.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The signed fixture must survive checkout on every platform byte for byte,
# or the signature it exists to prove stops verifying.
test/fixtures/*.json -text
